"copies :attr:`~function.__annotations__` if defined.  And now it also "
"gracefully skips over missing attributes such as :attr:`~function.__doc__` "
"which might not be defined for the wrapped callable."
msgstr ""
"Der Dekorator :deco:`functools.wraps` fügt nun ein "
