#: ../../whatsnew/3.2.rst:2135
msgid ""
"The :mod:`configparser` module was modified to improve usability and "
"predictability of the default parser and its supported INI syntax.  The "
"old :class:`!ConfigParser` class was removed in favor of :class:`!"
"SafeConfigParser` which has in turn been renamed "
"to :class:`~configparser.ConfigParser`. Support for inline comments is now "
"turned off by default and section or option duplicates are not allowed in a "
"single configuration source."
msgstr ""
"Das Modul :mod:`configparser` wurde geändert, um Benutzbarkeit und "
"Vorhersagbarkeit des Standard-Parsers und der von ihm unterstützten INI-"
